1783699329118773	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExvwQ		item.create	bn-w32	{"description":"Two CI failures blocking the bn-3hk umbrella: (1) miri fails on committer::tests::early_close_beats_sync_per_batch_at_4_writers (real mkdir under isolation) — needs #[cfg_attr(miri, ignore)] like every other real-fs test; (2) envelope-regression fails because floors.json was seeded from this workstation (Ryzen 3900X): CI runner is ~30% slower on CPU-bound BLAKE3 metrics (full_chain 1.40M<1.75M, load_verified 2.77M<3.23M) while beating the workstation on I/O. Fix: floors-ci.json seeded conservatively from observed CI numbers, workflow points at it; workstation floors.json remains the true envelope ratchet; document the machine-profile split in mess-bench.","kind":"task","labels":["ci"],"title":"CI green: miri guard for real-fs committer test + per-machine envelope floors"}	blake3:qYyhngvPasLGwhrS9UsfwwsGAPUkK1_D-f6V6t9lmng
