1783706716289474	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAEx2wQ		item.comment	bn-154	{"body":"Starting bn-154: read bone spec + bank/social/testkit/store references. Plan: split social into domain/user.rs + domain/post.rs + contracts.rs + lib.rs. Decisions forming: absorb (drop) HiddenBy* moderation events in favor of Deleted{by} (moderation is a separate bone); self-like ALLOWED, self-follow REJECTED; Follow command carries follower id since Decide can't see the stream id (dogfood note)."}	blake3:lnCxFGWjWqsm_WmmFPq-_XfpqnB8UycRtY4Y4tYkpUk
1783707325664866	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAEx3AQ		item.comment	bn-154	{"body":"Done: reworked examples/social into domain/user.rs + domain/post.rs + domain/mod.rs + contracts.rs + lib.rs. User(register/rename/follow/unfollow) + Post(create/delete/like/unlike) aggregates with all invariants in Decide. contracts.rs: PostView/ProfileView/TimelinePage DTOs, async ReadModels trait + wait_for barrier, WriteOps wrapper over EventStore returning log position for read-your-writes, deterministic FakeReadModels. Tests: 35 GWT (every accept+reject) + 8 fake-readmodel + 2 store-backed roundtrip = 45 green; clippy --all-targets -D warnings clean; cargo check --workspace green. Decisions: absorbed HiddenBy* into Deleted{by}; self-like allowed, self-follow rejected. Dogfood: (1) Decide can't see stream id -> Follow must restate follower id for self-check; (2) ident::Id is not Ord -> can't use BTreeSet for order-stable folds, used HashSet (order-independent Eq holds, but future fold-cert hashing needs order-independent set hash or Id:Ord); (3) cross-aggregate existence (Follow target exists) intentionally impossible in Decide."}	blake3:LXuwbTx_0wY1IEBRZQef3ybqfm7x3QTHzpxYNBweoBM
