1783717268483406	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExmQU		item.comment	bn-m3z	{"body":"Superseded by goal bn-gpq (Bob decision 2026-07-10: keep ONE social example, remodeled for scale). The snapshot-dogfood asks live on in bn-22v (Snapshottable + hot-post benchmark) and bn-o9z (doctor fold-drift against a store with real snapshots); the flagship snapshot story became projection checkpointing (bn-3vm)."}	blake3:1_xGvN62dwRT4AM4dEGwfVRZh7IdlfYJces5Q0TkoCo
