1783720431547137	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExsQU		item.comment	bn-jes	{"body":"Wave-21 adoption note: bn-2i3 landed the Actor trait + EventStore::command_as (checked actor/stream convention), but social contracts.rs still calls plain command — the swap was blocked by sibling file ownership. When remodeling Follow/Like as relationship streams here, use command_as for any command that carries its author stream (or note why the relationship key makes it moot). Also adopt CommandError::erase_store (bn-188) at the WriteError seam instead of the hand-rolled stringify."}	blake3:kp0pukJgukWsnEdK2PUjcmdgdX5iMld91CtqUEWPH30
