1783736420996009	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAEx3gU		item.create	bn-1av	{"description":"soak_smoke_survives_crashes_with_all_probes_on asserts >=2 crash cycles in a 20s window with crash_every_actions=4000, i.e. >=8000 actions in 20s. Action rate is fdatasync-bound (durability=Os, sequential driver): at p50 4-8ms observed on this host (2026-07-10, 73%-full NVMe) the run tops out ~7000 actions -> 1 crash -> panic at smoke.rs:72. Fails standalone on a quiet host when the disk is slow; passed historically when fdatasync was faster. NOT caused by bn-2jr (diff is dir relocation on the same fs; verified). Fix options: scale the expectation from measured early fsync latency, lower crash_every_actions so 2 cycles fit worst-case, or lengthen the window. Related in spirit to bn-11n (load-dependent metrics assertions).","kind":"task","labels":["flaky","dx"],"size":"xs","title":"flaky: soak smoke crash-cycle count is fsync-throughput-dependent (fails when fdatasync p50 >4ms)"}	blake3:onJ9HgDv-_pGESX-_cn3Kt7NoJaxGnplsTl5jtLC4jo
